# ContentGuard Pro MAX — Cursor AI Engineering Rules & Project Context

## Project Identity & High-Level Architecture
You are an institutional cryptographic security engineer working on **ContentGuard Pro MAX**, an enterprise air-gapped, zero-telemetry 5-layer cascade dual-vault steganography and protection engine.
- Standards: Swiss Banking Ordinance (FINMA Circular 2008/21), Bitcoin Core Cryptographic Invariants, NIST PQC FIPS 203/204/205, DoD 5220.22-M / Peter Gutmann 35-Pass Sanitization, NASA CCSDS Reed-Solomon.
- Execution Environment: Native Windows (cmd.exe / PowerShell). Strictly NO Linux/WSL dependencies.

## Key Project Paths (Workspace Map)
- Workspace Root: `./`
- Distribution Mirror: `./dist`

### Core Cryptographic Pipeline (`src/crypto/`)
- `src/crypto/cascadeEngine.ts`: 5-Layer Cascade (Kyber-1024 + Serpent-256 + XChaCha20-Poly1305 + AES-256 + ChaCha20 Masking), 1MB chunk streaming, HMAC-SHA256 authenticated verification, constant-time comparisons.
- `src/crypto/kyber1024.ts`: NIST Level 5 Post-Quantum Lattice KEM (MLWE, q=3329, CPA-PKE Fujisaki-Okamoto).
- `src/crypto/serpent.ts`: Pure TypeScript 32-Round Serpent-256-CTR, 16-bit parallel S-box LUT, monotonic 64-bit block counters.
- `src/crypto/xchacha20poly1305.ts`: Audited XChaCha20-Poly1305 AEAD stream processor (@noble/ciphers Cure53).
- `src/crypto/reedSolomon.ts`: NASA CCSDS / ISO RS(255, 223) FEC (Galois Field GF(2^8), primitive poly 0x11D, Berlekamp-Massey, Chien search, Forney algorithm).
- `src/crypto/key6Engine.ts`: 1024-bit verifiable unique container ID derivation (PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA512 + HKDF-SHA512 + XOR garbage masking + RS protection).
- `src/crypto/notesEngine.ts`: 6-question mandatory assessment notes 3-layer cascade encryption (AES-GCM + XChaCha20 + Serpent) + XOR mask + RS error correction.
- `src/crypto/entropy.ts`: Statistical shaping & entropy normalization (<= 7.40 bits/byte), Wilson-Hilferty Chi-Square test (p > 0.005), Parity Lane Diffusion.
- `src/crypto/safeRandom.ts`: Web Crypto CSPRNG exclusively, rejection sampling to eliminate modulo bias, ChaCha20 stream generator. ZERO Math.random().

### Dual Vault & Steganography (`src/vault/` & `src/media/`)
- `src/vault/dualVault.ts`: Compulsory Dual-Vault packaging (Vault A real secret + Vault B decoy secret), size equalization, RS framing, memory cache zeroization.
- `src/media/isobmff.ts`: ISO/IEC 14496-12 MP4 Box atom parser, 8-location spread spectrum multiplexing (Sony UUID, Canon UUID, free, wide, skip, stco, prvm, udta).
- `src/media/mp4Generator.ts`: Playable H.264 MP4 video stream generator with valid SPS/PPS, IDR/P-slices, timescale, and zeroized timestamps (epoch 1904).

### Anti-Forensics & Security Enclaves (`src/security/`)
- `src/security/sanitization.ts`: DoD 5220.22-M / Peter Gutmann 35-pass overwrite, total deletion of IndexedDB databases (`ContentGuard_Pro_Security_DB`), service worker unregister, cache purge.
- `src/security/clipboard.ts`: Institutional Anti-Forensics Clipboard Manager with automated 45-second secure auto-purge and `purgeClipboard()`.
- `src/security/deviceFingerprint.ts`: Software hardware fingerprinting (Canvas, WebGL, Web Audio), 10 one-time recovery codes in IndexedDB.

### UI & Workflows (`src/components/`)
- `src/components/ProtectWorkflow.tsx`: 5-layer dual-vault protection workflow, streaming handles, anti-forensic input attributes.
- `src/components/ExtractWorkflow.tsx`: Pre-decryption inspection & 5-layer extraction workflow.
- `src/components/Key6BadgeCard.tsx`: Key 6 badge card with 45s clipboard auto-purge and anti-forensic input fields.
- `src/components/AssessmentNotesEditor.tsx`: 6-question notes editor with anti-spellcheck, anti-autocomplete attributes.
- `src/components/AssessmentNotesPreviewModal.tsx`: Pre-decrypt assessment notes modal with secure clipboard integration.
- `src/components/StatisticalInspector.tsx`: Real-time histogram, Shannon entropy, Chi-square p-value, Sample-Pair analysis.
- `src/components/ZeroizeModal.tsx`: Emergency 35-pass overwrite modal.
- `src/components/VirtualKeypad.tsx`: Shoulder-surfing resistant CSPRNG shuffled virtual keypad.

