## Verification & Test Commands
Always verify your code passes 100% before finishing:
- TypeScript Check: `cmd.exe /c "npm run lint"` (`tsc --noEmit`)
- Full Test Suite: `cmd.exe /c "npm test"`
- Crypto Primitives: `cmd.exe /c "npm run test:crypto"`
- Protection & Extraction: `cmd.exe /c "npm run test:protect"`
- Reed-Solomon FEC: `cmd.exe /c "npm run test:rs"`
- Windows Security Audit: `cmd.exe /c "npm run test:audit"`
- Browser Automation: `cmd.exe /c "npm run test:browser"`
- Production Build: `cmd.exe /c "npm run build"`
